~ intro
Judge {{State.broadcaster_user.display_name}}: [do Utility.play_sound(gavel_sfx)]Order![wait=.35] [wave amp=25 freq=15]Order![/wave][do Utility.fade_out_sound(crowd_murmur_sfx_player, 2.5)]
Judge {{State.broadcaster_user.display_name}}: We're gathered here today to put chat on trial.
Judge {{State.broadcaster_user.display_name}}: You will all file your complaints. As the Judge, I reserve the right to dismiss any claims.[wait=.5] [speed=.6]So make them good.
Judge {{State.broadcaster_user.display_name}}: Let us proceed.
=> END

~ accusations_received
Judge {{State.broadcaster_user.display_name}}: We have received {{State.round_data.accusations.responses.size()}} complaint[if State.round_data.accusations.responses.size() > 1]s[/if].
Judge {{State.broadcaster_user.display_name}}: Let's see here...
=> END

~ no_accusations
Judge {{State.broadcaster_user.display_name}}: [speed=.25]. . . [speed=1.][wait=1.][font_size=18]No complaints?[/font_size]
Judge {{State.broadcaster_user.display_name}}: [do Utility.play_sound(gavel_sfx)]It seems the court is adjourned early today!
=> END

~ no_selected_accusation
Judge {{State.broadcaster_user.display_name}}: Well.[wait=1.] These complaints all sucked.
Judge {{State.broadcaster_user.display_name}}: [do Utility.play_sound(gavel_sfx)]Court is adjourned early today!
=> END

~ accusation_selected
Judge {{State.broadcaster_user.display_name}}: Ah. Here's one. {{State.round_data.selected_accusation.user_display_name}} has a complaint against {{State.round_data.selected_accusation.accused_name}}.
Judge {{State.broadcaster_user.display_name}}: {{State.round_data.selected_accusation.user_display_name}} and {{State.round_data.selected_accusation.accused_name}}! Please approach the stands.
if State.round_data.selected_accusation.accuser_id.is_empty():
	Judge {{State.broadcaster_user.display_name}}: [speed=.25]. . . [speed=1.][wait=1.][font_size=18]{{State.round_data.selected_accusation.accused_name}}?[/font_size]
	Judge {{State.broadcaster_user.display_name}}: Well...[wait=.25] Looks like {{State.round_data.selected_accusation.accused_name}} is not joining us today.
	Judge {{State.broadcaster_user.display_name}}: We will have to proceed to the jury verdict without them!
=> END